  "system": {
    "featureForm": "reaction",
    "description": "<p>When a PC moves within Melee range, you can <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to make an attack roll against them. On a successful attack, the target takes <strong>3d6</strong> physical damage and is Swallowed. While Swallowed, the target is <em>Restrained</em> and takes <strong>3d6</strong> physical damage when the Beguiler takes the spotlight. The Beguiler disgorges all Swallowed creatures when it takes Major or Severe damage.</p>",
